      "writtenOn": "2024-07-19T04:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OOC: Could I know the reason for having OpenUrlActivity in `FerrochromeApp`, not `VmLauncherApp`? If `VmLauncherApp` could receive URL information via intent, I prefer to be there.",
      "revId": "88503eae385e78001f62ccd31283e7743e6efcd9",
